- `number_of_pages` is computed from `int(imagecount)`. It is `imagecount - 4` when that is at least 1, otherwise the original count. It is omitted when `imagecount` is absent.

I have not run the tests. I could not see the test sources, so the three-letter branch and the mocking of `web.ctx.site` are inferred from the requirements.

