                           "Rack Mount Chassis", "Sealed-case PC", "Multi-system",
                           "CompactPCI", "AdvancedTCA", "Blade", "Blade Enclosure",
                           "Tablet", "Convertible", "Detachable", "IoT Gateway",
                           "Embedded PC", "Mini PC", "Stick PC"]

